From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sunu Aziz Rahayu <sunuazizrahayu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] build: prefer Etar over Calendar in GSI system image

AOSP Calendar sudah dihapus di Lineage 23.2 (packages/apps/Calendar
tidak ada), sehingga Soong gagal:

  "aosp_system_image" depends on undefined module "Calendar"

Lineage memakai Etar sebagai penggantinya (overrides: ["Calendar"]),
jadi tukar dependensinya ke Etar.

---
 target/product/gsi/Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/target/product/gsi/Android.bp b/target/product/gsi/Android.bp
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/target/product/gsi/Android.bp
+++ b/target/product/gsi/Android.bp
@@ -187,7 +187,7 @@ android_system_image {

         // handheld_product
         "AvatarPicker",
-        "Calendar",
+        "Etar",
         "Contacts",
         "DeskClock",
         "Gallery2",
--
2.54.0
